=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eAnnotation tokens (thinking + XML)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-options='[&quot;8192 (current budget)&quot;,&quot;16384&quot;,&quot;32768&quot;]' data-allow-select-none='false' data-searchable='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-dropdown></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='bkHC-6' random-id='d4d7f34d-8792-4153-196f-760994544444'><marimo-dropdown data-initial-value='[&quot;max&quot;]' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eMiniMax thinking depth&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-options='[&quot;low&quot;,&quot;medium&quot;,&quot;high&quot;,&quot;xhigh&quot;,&quot;max&quot;]' data-allow-select-none='false' data-searchable='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-dropdown></marimo-ui-element></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Annotation:</strong> defaults remain 8192 tokens / max thinking. If MiniMax returns <code>length</code>, inspect the raw-response sidecar, then consider 16384 tokens / medium thinking before clicking 2a again. A larger budget may cost more; retries are never automatic. Changed settings affect only new API calls, not cached records.</span></span><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='bkHC-7' random-id='0f44917c-c85c-ffba-0921-30062a9386be'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e2a. Prepare/Resume atomization (API may cost)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='bkHC-8' random-id='a13bacc0-f8a7-531f-d97f-9c1695386002'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e2b. Validate existing raw + atoms&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='bkHC-9' random-id='a4cf2644-834b-e279-651b-8482292b6e60'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003col start=&#92;&quot;3&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cli&#92;u003eSave/verify experiment config&#92;u003c/li&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003c/ol&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='bkHC-10' random-id='4f4dd013-51e2-507e-f94c-3bc6dc407f53'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003col start=&#92;&quot;4&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cli&#92;u003eGPU preflight (1 step)&#92;u003c/li&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003c/ol&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='bkHC-11' random-id='272861cf-46cf-1b43-b335-db85469a894e'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003col start=&#92;&quot;5&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cli&#92;u003eTrain (new run)&#92;u003c/li&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003c/ol&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='bkHC-12' random-id='b917ea80-9e35-70dd-cbd6-67ad43b487a5'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eResume exact checkpoint&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='bkHC-13' random-id='907f91e6-6a4a-8fdb-6ad1-b227ad0ad7fc'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003col start=&#92;&quot;6&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cli&#92;u003eEvaluate best checkpoint&#92;u003c/li&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003c/ol&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='bkHC-14' random-id='803af000-f62a-fa22-894b-b5427dd63fa6'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;